cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AEC Knowledge Graph"
abstract: >-
  A GraphRAG-powered knowledge engine for the built environment: it ingests
  the buildingSMART IFC 4.3 schema (bSDD + EXPRESS) into a Neo4j knowledge
  graph, answers natural-language questions about it through an LLM agent
  with graph-query tools, lets domain experts define new civil engineering
  concepts in the Universal Civil Knowledge Schema (UCKS), and exports
  buildingSMART IDS specifications.
authors:
